{"seq":3,"slug":"tier-expiry-downgrade-reinstatement","title":"等级到期、降级与恢复保护：宽限期、锁定与状态回写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/membership-tier-benefits-entitlement-engine/tier-state-lifecycle-model/tier-expiry-downgrade-reinstatement","wordCount":3360,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"等级到期-降级与恢复保护-宽限期-锁定与状态回写\">等级到期、降级与恢复保护：宽限期、锁定与状态回写</h1><p>一个 Gold 会员在 12 月 31 日 23:59 还差 137 元达标，1 月 1 日 00:01 系统把他降成 Silver。他 1 月 2 日下单时发现免邮没了、专线进不去了，于是投诉「我明明上周还是 Gold」。这类争议的根因几乎总是同一个：<strong>系统把「评定周期的结束」和「等级的到期」当成了同一个时刻</strong>。等级到期不是一次 <code>UPDATE tier</code>，它由评定周期、权益周期、宽限期、锁定窗口四条时间轴共同定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>等级（tier）是<strong>基于一段时间内累积行为的评定结果</strong>，不是可以直接赋值的属性。它的状态机由时间推进驱动：用户什么都不做，等级也会因为周期结束而迁移。这与积分账户有本质差异——积分是<strong>余额</strong>，随消费增减；等级是<strong>区间函数</strong>，只在评定窗口闭合时求值一次。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>积分账户（points balance）</th>\n<th>等级状态（tier status）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语义</td>\n<td>可消耗余额，连续变化</td>\n<td>周期评定的离散档位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变化触发</td>\n<td>每次赚取/消耗，实时</td>\n<td>评定窗口闭合（周期边界）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否有宽限期</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有，且是争议高发区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回滚语义</td>\n<td>冲正单笔流水</td>\n<td>不能冲正，只能重评并回写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>到期含义</td>\n<td>积分过期（批次先进先出）</td>\n<td>等级降级（按档位下调）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本 hub 另两篇分别处理等级状态的持久化建模与权益目录的授权投影，章节入口见 <a href=\"./\">等级状态与生命周期模型</a>；权益侧的下游依赖见 <a href=\"../benefit-catalog-entitlement/\">权益目录与授权建模</a>。等级由四条独立边界定义：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[评定窗口开始] --&gt; B[评定窗口闭合]&#10;  B --&gt; C{是否达标}&#10;  C --&gt;|达标| D[新等级生效]&#10;  C --&gt;|未达标| E[进入宽限期]&#10;  E --&gt;|补足| D&#10;  E --&gt;|期末仍未达标| F[降级执行]&#10;  F --&gt; G[锁定窗口]&#10;  G --&gt;|锁定到期| H[权益切换为新档位]&#10;  D --&gt; I[下一评定窗口开始]&#10;  I --&gt; B\">graph TD\n  A[评定窗口开始] --&gt; B[评定窗口闭合]\n  B --&gt; C{是否达标}\n  C --&gt;|达标| D[新等级生效]\n  C --&gt;|未达标| E[进入宽限期]\n  E --&gt;|补足| D\n  E --&gt;|期末仍未达标| F[降级执行]\n  F --&gt; G[锁定窗口]\n  G --&gt;|锁定到期| H[权益切换为新档位]\n  D --&gt; I[下一评定窗口开始]\n  I --&gt; B</pre><p><code>评定窗口闭合</code> 与 <code>降级执行</code> <strong>必须</strong>是不同时刻。把二者合一意味着零缓冲，对任何有实物权益（免邮、包退、专线）的会员体系都不可接受——用户的最后一次消费可能发生在闭合前几小时，系统却在闭合瞬间收走权益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评定周期与到期时点的解析\">评定周期与到期时点的解析</h2><p>第一个陷阱是<strong>口径</strong>：自然年、滚动 12 个月，还是固定会员年（从注册日起算）。自然年最简单，但让 12 月的边际消费只有一个月寿命、1 月的却有十二个月；滚动 12 个月抹平了这个不公，代价是<strong>每个用户每天都有到期事件</strong>，百万会员的体系必须做成按日切片的增量评估。固定会员年最贴合运营习惯，也最容易在跨境场景出错——同一份规则下美国用户按日历年、欧盟用户按会员年评定，源于历史惯例而非法规要求，却会在合并报表时制造错位。</p>\n<p>到期时点要精确到一个<strong>业务日</strong>。Marriott Bonvoy 与 Hilton Honors 的条款都把当年达标等级的有效期延续至次年年初的固定截止日。这个日期承担三重职能：<strong>对账缓冲</strong>（给跨年结算、退款留出回溯窗口）、<strong>运营窗口</strong>（给降级前挽留的触达留时间）与<strong>时区一致</strong>（截止时刻落在统一时区的业务日边界上，否则同一订单在不同时区得出不同评定结果）。</p>\n<p>评定值是加权和，达标判定是阈值比较：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>≥</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{u} = \\sum_{i \\in W(u)} w_i \\cdot a_i \\quad\\ge\\quad \\tau_{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2247em;vertical-align:-0.4747em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2253em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4747em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是用户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 在评定窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W(u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 内的等级积分，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 笔合格行为，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是行为权重（航空体系里「定级里程」与「定级航段」按比例折算），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是档位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 的门槛。必须把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 提出代码、做成版本化配置：历史窗口重算必须使用<strong>当时生效的版本</strong>，否则一次权重调整会成批改判存量会员。另一个易漏的细节是<strong>资格行为的归属时点</strong>：按「下单时间」还是「完成时间」计入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W(u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，跨境差别巨大——预售与直邮的履约周期可横跨数月，行业实践通常按完成/履约计入（酒店按退房日、航空按飞行日）；退款必须能从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 扣回，评定值因而必须<strong>可重算</strong>而非只能追加。</p>\n<h2 id=\"宽限期与软着陆-降级的缓冲设计\">宽限期与软着陆：降级的缓冲设计</h2><p>宽限期（grace period）解决两个不同问题，必须分开设计。第一个是<strong>执行缓冲</strong>：评定窗口闭合后系统需要时间做对账、争议处理、批量评估，这段内等级不能提前失效，否则一笔在途结算订单就可能造成误降级；它通常几天到几周，对用户不可见。第二个是<strong>体验缓冲</strong>：用户知道自己未达标，但希望行为（尤其年末冲刺消费）被承认；它可长达数月，且<strong>必须对用户可见</strong>——用户不知道有宽限期，宽限期就等于不存在。两者都应做成<strong>显式状态</strong>，而不是靠「延迟执行定时任务」模拟：后者会让库里用户仍是 Gold、实际已未达标，任一次并发评估都可能把状态改回去。\n软着陆（soft landing）是宽限期的近亲，语义不同：<strong>宽限期是保持当前等级，软着陆是只降一级</strong>。一个 Diamond 成员未达 Diamond 门槛但达到 Gold 门槛时，单级软着陆会把他降到 Platinum 而非按实际达标值降到 Gold。常旅客体系普遍采用单级软着陆，因为它显著降低重度用户的流失动机——从 Diamond 直落 Silver 的体验断裂足以让用户放弃整个体系。两者可量化为一次期望收益比较：设降级后流失概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>churn</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{churn}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">churn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，挽回成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>win</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{win}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">win</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，保留的边际权益成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>keep</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{keep}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">keep</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则缓冲值得投入的条件近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>LT</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>churn</mtext></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>keep</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>churn</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>win</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{LT}} \\cdot p_{\\text{churn}} \\;&gt;\\; c_{\\text{keep}} + p_{\\text{churn}} \\cdot c_{\\text{win}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">LT</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">churn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">keep</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">churn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">win</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>LT</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{LT}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">LT</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越大缓冲越划算，因此<strong>宽限期应按档位分层</strong>：高档位给长缓冲与单级软着陆，低档位给短缓冲甚至直接降级。另有一个易漏的约束是<strong>宽限期内权益的有效性边界</strong>：用户在宽限期内仍是 Gold，他的免邮按原速率限流还是无限使用？多数体系选择完全等同，因为半吊子的宽限期比干脆降级更伤信任。</p>\n<h2 id=\"等级锁定与权益冻结-把-不可逆-变成可回滚\">等级锁定与权益冻结：把「不可逆」变成可回滚</h2><p>降级在业务上<strong>可逆</strong>（补足消费即可恢复），在数据上却常被实现成不可逆的覆写。这是第二个投诉源：用户补足了消费，但系统已把等级列改成 Silver，恢复逻辑没实现，或实现了却漏掉权益重建。锁定（tier lock）把这段不可逆窗口显式化：<strong>锁定期内等级按新档位生效，但保留旧档位的恢复资格</strong>。锁定记录需要三个字段：锁定前档位、锁定原因（未达标降级 / 主动放弃 / 风控冻结）、锁定到期时点。有了它们，恢复就变成一次<strong>判定</strong>而不是一次<strong>猜测</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>保护机制</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>状态语义</th>\n<th>典型代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>执行缓冲</td>\n<td>评定窗口闭合</td>\n<td>等级不变，评估延后</td>\n<td>数据时效性下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体验宽限期</td>\n<td>未达标</td>\n<td>等级保持，权益等值</td>\n<td>权益成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单级软着陆</td>\n<td>未达标</td>\n<td>只降一级</td>\n<td>中间档位成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等级锁定</td>\n<td>降级后</td>\n<td>新档位生效 + 恢复资格</td>\n<td>状态复杂度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权益冻结</td>\n<td>风控/争议</td>\n<td>等级保留，权益暂停</td>\n<td>客服工单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态匹配</td>\n<td>外部等级凭证</td>\n<td>授予有期限的对等档位</td>\n<td>薅羊毛风险</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>锁定与权益冻结必须分开建模。锁定描述<strong>恢复资格</strong>（能否拿回旧等级），冻结描述<strong>权益可用性</strong>（当下能否用权益）。二者正交：因风控被冻结的 Diamond 等级资格完好但权益暂停；软着陆后的 Silver 权益正常但持恢复资格。把两者塞进同一字段，会导致「解冻」误触发「恢复等级」，或「恢复等级」意外「解冻」仍在调查中的账号。锁定的到期时点还要与<strong>行为可达性</strong>匹配：若锁定期为「90 天内补足差额即可恢复」，这 90 天必须与新评定窗口有重叠，否则用户在锁定期内累积的行为既不能用于恢复、也不计入新周期，等于被罚两次；通行做法是允许锁定期行为<strong>双计</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态回写-事件重放-幂等与回溯重算\">状态回写：事件重放、幂等与回溯重算</h2><p>到期判定几乎不可能是实时的，它依赖一批已发生但可能尚未结算完成的事件，因此核心难题是<strong>幂等与顺序</strong>。具体场景：1 月 3 日，一笔 12 月 28 日的订单退款事件到达，该退款扣回了 12 月评定中曾计入的金额，用户不再达标；此时系统已在新窗口给了用户 Silver。回写要回答：回滚到 Gold 吗？不——他 12 月本就未达标——正确答案是维持 Silver，但前提是<strong>降级决策可重放</strong>：系统要能重新执行「窗口闭合 → 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> → 比较 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>」，得到与当初一致的结果。</p>\n<p>这就是评定必须做成<strong>纯函数</strong>的原因。把评定写成 <code>evaluate(user, window, rule_version)</code>，输入是事件切片与规则版本、输出是档位，回写问题就退化为「重放」问题。反之，只要任一步读了「当前时间」「当前余额」「上一次评定结果」这类可变外部状态，重放必然产生不同结果，系统就失去自愈能力。跨境场景还有一项额外要求：<strong>多币种结算的汇率时点</strong>——同一笔欧元订单在 12 月 31 日与 1 月 2 日折算出的美元值不同，可能造成达标与不达标两种结果，通行做法是把汇率<strong>冻结在订单完成时点</strong>。</p>\n<p>回写链路的形状是：order/refund/cancel 事件落入 append-only 日志 → 按窗口切片聚合 → 送入纯函数评定 → 与当前档位比较。一致则无操作；降级则写锁定记录并落变更流水；升级则立即生效并触发权益重投影。下游权益系统异步消费流水，因此<strong>等级写回与权益生效之间必然存在窗口</strong>，权益侧须按最终一致设计。变更流水还必须记录变更前后档位、触发原因与规则版本——在欧盟 GDPR 第 22 条语境下，当降级由完全自动化流程做出并对用户产生实质影响时，用户有权要求人工干预与解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"恢复与回归-重新评定-状态匹配与挽留\">恢复与回归：重新评定、状态匹配与挽留</h2><p>恢复（reinstatement）有三个来源，规则完全不同，却常被实现成同一条代码路径。<strong>补足恢复</strong>：用户在锁定窗口内补足差额，判定就是重跑一次评定函数；它必须使用<strong>旧档位的门槛与规则版本</strong>，否则一次门槛上调会让所有锁定中的用户都无法恢复。<strong>状态匹配（status match）</strong>：用户持外部体系等级申请对等档位，这是跨境电商拉新的常用手段；通行防御是<strong>匹配 + 挑战（match + challenge）</strong>——先给一段有期限的对等档位，要求在期内达到本体系达标值否则回落，门槛太低等于白送、太高则无人达标。<strong>主动挽留</strong>：触达必须发生在<strong>降级之前</strong>，否则话术就从「还差一点」变成「你被降级了」；因此到期评估需要产出<strong>预降级名单</strong>，而不仅是降级结果。</p>\n<p>一个反直觉的边界是<strong>降级后立即恢复</strong>：用户补足消费应恢复旧档位，但不重复发放一次性入会/升级礼遇。解法是把一次性权益与等级状态解耦——权益由「等级迁移事件」触发发放，恢复则走「等级回到旧值」，事件类型不同，天然不发礼遇；这条解耦正是本 hub 权益目录章节要建立的能力，见 <a href=\"../benefit-redemption-fulfillment/\">权益核销与履约</a>。最后是<strong>不可恢复的降级</strong>：注销、违规封停、或体系下线某档位，这类降级不进入锁定期，须走独立入口并在变更流水标注原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>到期不等于评定窗口闭合</strong>：四条时间轴（评定窗口、权益周期、宽限期、锁定窗口）必须显式建模，把闭合与降级执行合一是投诉头号来源。</li>\n<li><strong>宽限期与软着陆按档位分层</strong>：技术缓冲不可见、业务缓冲必须可见；软着陆是否划算由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>LT</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>churn</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>keep</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>churn</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>win</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{LT}} \\cdot p_{\\text{churn}} &gt; c_{\\text{keep}} + p_{\\text{churn}} \\cdot c_{\\text{win}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">LT</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">churn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">keep</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">churn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">win</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定。</li>\n<li><strong>锁定与冻结正交</strong>：锁定管恢复资格，冻结管权益可用性，塞进同一字段会引发连锁误动作。</li>\n<li><strong>评定必须是纯函数</strong>：<code>evaluate(user, window, rule_version)</code> 可重放，退款与汇率修正才能自愈。</li>\n<li><strong>恢复有三条路径</strong>（补足、状态匹配、主动挽留），门槛与规则版本按旧档位解析；一次性礼遇与迁移事件解耦。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"等级到期、降级与恢复保护：宽限期、锁定与状态回写","id":"等级到期-降级与恢复保护-宽限期-锁定与状态回写"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"评定周期与到期时点的解析","id":"评定周期与到期时点的解析"},{"level":2,"text":"宽限期与软着陆：降级的缓冲设计","id":"宽限期与软着陆-降级的缓冲设计"},{"level":2,"text":"等级锁定与权益冻结：把「不可逆」变成可回滚","id":"等级锁定与权益冻结-把-不可逆-变成可回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"状态回写：事件重放、幂等与回溯重算","id":"状态回写-事件重放-幂等与回溯重算"},{"level":2,"text":"恢复与回归：重新评定、状态匹配与挽留","id":"恢复与回归-重新评定-状态匹配与挽留"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"等级资格计算与升降级引擎：滚动窗口、评估节奏与软着陆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/membership-tier-benefits-entitlement-engine/tier-state-lifecycle-model/tier-qualification-recalculation-engine"},"next":{"title":"权益目录分类与建模：权益类型、原子项与权益包","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/membership-tier-benefits-entitlement-engine/benefit-catalog-entitlement/benefit-catalog-taxonomy"}}